cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  A Benchmark Suite and Ground-Truth Methodology for Formal
  Verification of IEC 61131-3 Ladder Diagram Programs
message: >-
  If you use this benchmark suite, please cite both the
  accompanying paper and this artifact.
type: dataset
version: 1.0.0
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: https://github.com/pierredantas/esbmc-plc-benchmark-suite
abstract: >-
  A suite of 50 IEC 61131-3 benchmarks over 83 program variants
  (15 textual Ladder Diagram, 25 graphical Ladder Diagram, 10
  Structured Text) across ten industrial domains, each paired with
  a formal safety property, a machine-checkable expected verdict, a
  recorded ground-truth method, and a triggering witness for every
  violation. Packaged in an SV-COMP-compatible layout with a JSON
  Schema, validator, tool adapters, and a one-command re-check
  harness.
